 ears after murdering his sister on Halloween night 1963\, Michael Myers e
 scapes from a mental hospital and returns to the small town of Haddonfiel
 d\, Illinois\, to kill again. - IMDB\n \nHalloween is an absolutely merc
 iless thriller\, a movie so violent and scary that\, yes\, I would compar
 e it to “Psycho.” - Roger Ebert\n \nWatch the trailer here:  https:
 //www.youtube.com/watch?v=3JsrH8eUVOo \n \n\n \n \n\n \n\n \n \nFo
